                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Score: 2/5\nA big old nothing burger inspired by old-school DnD and maybe Dungeon Crawl Classics.\nI full party wiped on the second group of enemies I faced. I don't think I enjoyed a single minute of the game.\n\nArt style is okay.\nAudio/SFX/Music is below average.\nWriting is average, with some cheesy tropes.\nLarge number of characters, almost all are super shallow. World revolves around player.\nGoing with a old-school DnD style with the randomized stats, but then making possible perks randomized too, and with infinite rerolling. I strongly prefer point-buy.\nNot enough information to make good decisions.\nMenu navigation is slow and clunky.\nCombat is boring and difficult.\nWorld is pretty big but mostly empty, with few PoI's and clunky navigation, especially diagonal movement.",
